{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1537639-shunned-by-the-moon-five-years-later-appreciating-tide-breaker","id":1537639,"title":"Shunned By The Moon Five Years Later: Appreciating Tide-Breaker.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-06-18T19:05:32-07:00","id":1537639,"title":"Shunned By The Moon Five Years Later: Appreciating Tide-Breaker.","content":"Hey all, Korogra here! I hope you\u2019ve all been well! I have been going over some of the Night Horrors as I prepared for a session in my werewolf game when I stopped to read over an antagonist I usually would overlook, Tejumola Tide-Breaker, and I realized I had found quite possibly one of my favorite Ivory Claws ever.<br /> <br /> Living through 2020 gave me a tremendous new appreciation for the Contagion meta plot and has inspired me to quietly build up a portfolio of characters and contagion strains to eventually throw at my werewolf group down the line.. and I think Tide-Breaker would be a perfect vessel to act as a bridge for those eventual storylines. To those who do not know-or for those of you who are rusty with the book- Tejumola Tide-Breaker is an Ivory Claw who has miraculously been able to create a number of non-Contagious, \u201csafe\u201d Geryo through a mix of inspired biological engineering and horrific Tzuumfin blood-sorcery rites inflicted on an unfortunate collection of captive Scarborn: Uratha whose First Changes are linked to Moon Quakes and possess incredibly enhanced regenerative powers.. at the cost of indescribable agony every time they shift form.<br /> <br /> The thing is, I don\u2019t think that Tejumola has any true affiliation to either the Sworn or The False, nor does she have any real knowledge of the Contagion beyond the Geryo Strain. Her work though.. I definitely believe the Factions are at least aware of what she has done and more than a few parties would love nothing more than to either recruit her into their service, or steal her \u201csterilized\u201d monsters for their own purposes- either as weapons or as a possible source of inoculation against flesh warping forms of the Contagion.<br /> <br /> I could see a wonderful myriad of RE inspired stories revolving around these groups trying to bring her into their fold.<br /> <br /> And I could think of nothing more sacrilegious to the Ivory Claws than to lose their Tide-Breaker or her pets.<br /> <br /> But what do you all think? Let me know what you would do with Tenumola and her Geryo wardogs, I\u2019d love to hear your ideas!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}